  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Agricultural Support for Vulnerable Flood-Affected Smallholder Paddy Farmers through Voucher Scheme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enable flood-affected smallholder paddy farmers to resume timely cultivation during the Maha 2025/2026 and Yala 2026 seasons by restoring access to essential agricultural inputs through a commodity voucher modality, thereby protecting livelihoods and contributing to household food security and early recovery.</narrative>
